{"4005350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farming & Defense - Farmfence", "steam_appid": 4005350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermarket Simulator meets Farming Simulator—with zombies.</strong> In this genre-blending simulator and survival game, you’ll build and manage your own supermarket by day, grow crops like a seasoned Farming Simulator pro, and defend your land from relentless zombie hordes after dark. Every cycle is a test of strategy and speed: stock shelves, optimize your farm layout, and prepare your defenses before the sun sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.poster.avif?t=1786770311\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.webm?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.mp4?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farmfence</strong> is a strategic survival game where peaceful farming by day turns into desperate defense by night. Grow crops, manage resources, and build your homestead—then brace yourself as waves of undead swarm your fields after sunset. Can you harvest enough to survive the horrors of the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/e3106adf12fffd3be3812dfbf29a5b27.poster.avif?t=1786770311\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/e3106adf12fffd3be3812dfbf29a5b27.webm?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/e3106adf12fffd3be3812dfbf29a5b27.mp4?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending farming simulation with tower defense mechanics, <i>Farmfence</i> challenges players to balance productivity and protection in a dynamic day-night cycle. Customize your farm layout, upgrade your defenses, and unlock new tools to withstand increasingly aggressive zombie raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/51532eddf0b077ec058a56351e646bd1.poster.avif?t=1786770311\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/51532eddf0b077ec058a56351e646bd1.webm?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/51532eddf0b077ec058a56351e646bd1.mp4?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual builder or a tactical survivor, <i>Farmfence</i> offers a unique twist on the farming genre with fast-paced combat, strategic planning, and satisfying progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌞 <strong>Day-Night Gameplay Loop</strong>: Farm by day, defend by night—each cycle brings new challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 <strong>Crop Management</strong>: Plant, grow, and harvest a variety of crops to fuel your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟 <strong>Zombie Defense</strong>: Build fences, turrets, and traps to protect your farm from nightly invasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ <strong>Base Building</strong>: Design your farm layout for both efficiency and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ <strong>Upgrade System</strong>: Unlock new tools, structures, and abilities as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Strategic Depth</strong>: Balance resource allocation between farming and fortification.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/b6d67a2a68d9c6b360948c4268f2be63.poster.avif?t=1786770311\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/b6d67a2a68d9c6b360948c4268f2be63.webm?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/b6d67a2a68d9c6b360948c4268f2be63.mp4?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermarket Simulator meets Farming Simulator—with zombies.</strong> In this genre-blending simulator and survival game, you’ll build and manage your own supermarket by day, grow crops like a seasoned Farming Simulator pro, and defend your land from relentless zombie hordes after dark. Every cycle is a test of strategy and speed: stock shelves, optimize your farm layout, and prepare your defenses before the sun sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.poster.avif?t=1786770311\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005350/extras/efd5f88307c39773b09e83ca43f16fba.webm?t=1786770311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9